# Beyond Infinity (jeuno 137): the finishes when their state no longer holds (a GM changes it while the event is open).
# A level 91 Warrior at level cap 95, Prelude to Puissance completed, the Limit Breaker and the Soul Gem Clasp held,
# MAX_LEVEL 99. The available 10045 open, a GM's cap 94: the finish (option 13) finds no state: not begun. Accepted with
# Prog 1 (a GM): 10139 open, the quest set available by a GM: the finish finds only the available state (no 10139
# finish): nothing (not completed, cap 95).
lists RuludeGardens/Nomad_Moogle/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10045 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10139
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=11.5,2.5,121.9 job=WAR lvl=91
levelcap 95
quest Jeuno.PreludeToPuissance completed
keyitem LimitBreaker
keyitem SoulGemClasp
login
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # available: 10045 (91, 1, 5, 0, 0)
levelcap 94                             # a GM, while 10045 is open
finish option=13                        # no state at the finish: not begun
levelcap 95                             # a GM
quest Jeuno.BeyondInfinity accepted     # a GM
charvar Quest[3][137]Prog 1             # a GM: Prog 1
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # accepted, Prog 1: 10139 (75, 1)
quest Jeuno.BeyondInfinity available    # a GM, while 10139 is open
finish                                  # only the available state holds: no 10139 finish: nothing (cap 95)
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # available: 10045 (91, 1, 5, 0, 0)
finish option=0                         # nothing
